WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.569
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.036
We hope everybody
is doing well tonight.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:06.072
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.641
President Biden claimed
in a new interview

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.476
that the coronavirus pandemic
is over.

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:13.379
Well, easy for him to say --
he just had it.

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:14.647
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.716
Of course, it's over when
you've got the antibodies.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:19.518
"I'm off to Burning Man and then
London for the Queen's funeral.

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:22.355
No masks. No masks."

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:26.058
CBS is facing criticism over
its decision to end coverage

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:28.294
of Queen Elizabeth's funeral
yesterday

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:30.764
in order to air episodes of
"Let's Make a Deal,"

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:32.465
and "The Price is Right..."

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.934
Though, if you're a fan
of those two shows,

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.337
you've probably seen plenty
of funerals.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:40.373
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:44.677
That's right -- They cut away
from Queen Elizabeth's funeral

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:47.013
yesterday to air episodes of
"Let's Make a Deal"

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.149
and "The Price is Right,"
or as the British Empire

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:51.017
used to call those,
foreign policy.

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:53.253
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.254
Former President Trump has
reportedly said

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:58.191
that Florida governor
Ron Desantis stole his idea

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.259
to send migrants
to different states.

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:03.897
Also, his idea of standing
like it's your first time.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:06.933
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:15.742
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
recently dropped

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:17.377
on the Bloomberg
Billionaire Index

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:19.312
to the third-richest person
in the world.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.981
He lost his spot when he bought
a Tesla.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:24.983
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.983 --> 00:01:27.554
Former Secretary of State
Mike Pompeo spoke this morning

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:30.390
at the New Hampshire Institute
of Politics speaker series,

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.058
titled, "Politics and Eggs,"

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:35.094
I assume as one of the eggs?

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:38.131
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.868
I-I assume.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:44.137
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:46.071
It wasn't a joke.
It was an assumption.

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:48.107
I don't...

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:49.575
Pompeo criticized
President Biden

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:51.778
for his recent speech
attacking the MAGA movement,

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:54.513
and said, quote, "Treating
your countryman like enemies

00:01:54.513 --> 00:01:57.383
is a rejection of the principles
that make America great."

00:01:57.383 --> 00:02:00.420
Oh, so maybe they were chanting
"Hug Mike Pence."

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.456
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:07.626
Tampa Bay Buccaneers
Quarterback Tom Brady apologized

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:10.029
on Sunday after throwing
a tablet on the sidelines.

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:11.497
To be fair, new technology

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:14.100
can be hard for boomers
to figure out.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:17.336
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:19.338
A lawyer in Kentucky was
recently suspended

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:21.708
after he allegedly offered
to help a defendant

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:23.709
in exchange for nude photos.

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:26.813
It's the rare case of a lawyer
trying to get himself off.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:29.883
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.854 --> 00:02:38.724
Scollins? Yeah, Scollins.

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:41.861
And finally, Christmas is now
less than 100 days away.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:43.763
Or, if you ask Costco, six.

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:44.831
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:47.267
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

